<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Sons Gwalia says has 93.1 pct Orion.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Sons Gwalia says has 93.1 pct Orion.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sons of Gwalia Ltd said on Tuesday that it has extended its offer for Orion Resources NL by 14 days until October 22 and that it now had 93.1 percent of Orion.</p>
<p>Sons of Gwalia said the extension of the offer came after Orion directors withdrew their previous recommendation rejecting Sons of Gwalia's A$1.80 per share offer and said they would accept the offer.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800.</p>
</text>
